## Execution Boundary

This approved roadmap authorizes faithful campaign derivation under the active Tool Shed authority
envelope. This promotion action does not materialize campaigns, edit source, commit, push, publish,
deploy, access credentials, or cross a protected environment. Each milestone must return evidence
to its gates and propagate its reconciled result to the Idea-rooted outcome loop.

